<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis Amev 9 mth NET up 17 percent.</title>
<headline>Fortis Amev 9 mth NET up 17 percent.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First 9 months 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   605    vs 519</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)		 3.33 vs   2.89</p>
<p>Note - Fortis Amev NV is one of the parents of financial services group Fortis, which was formed in 1989 through a merger of Dutch Amev and Belgian Groupe AG.</p>
